\par\par \b \uc2  Asia Markets-Grim economy offsets gains on the Dow. \b0\par\par\uc2      By Natsuko Waki \par \uc2 910 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 3 Juli 2001\par 12:10\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2      SINGAPORE, July 3 (Reuters) - Key Asian equity markets were \par \par \uc2  marginally higher, aided by U.S. blue chips, but others fell \par \par \uc2  due to the underlying gloomy sentiment about the economy. \par \par \uc2      In Japan, the benchmark Nikkei average closed in positive \par \par \uc2  territory. But the mood was still sour after the Bank of \par \par \uc2  Japan's tankan business sentiment survey on Monday reinforced \par \par \uc2  fears about the faltering economy. \par \par \uc2      "The market was nursing a hangover from the tankan \par \par \uc2  yesterday," an equity analyst in Tokyo said. \par \par \uc2      Dealers said volume was thin and trading would remain \par \par \uc2  rangebound ahead of the Upper House election on July 29. \par \par \uc2      The leading Liberal Democratic Party must perform well in \par \par \uc2  the election in order for Prime Minister Junichiro Koizumi to \par \par \uc2  press ahead with reform plans he has pledged to deliver. \par \par \uc2      Public support for Koizumi is sky-high at 84 percent, \par \par \uc2  according to a recent newspaper survey. \par \par \uc2      The yen held firm at around 123.80 from 124.30 late in New \par \par \uc2  York on Monday. \par \par \uc2      PESO SUFFERS \par \par \uc2      The steadier yen helped most regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  to trim \par \par \uc2  their recent losses. \par \par \uc2      But the peso suffered home-grown afflictions, slipping to \par \par \uc2  fresh 5-=   month lows of 52.97 per dollar as corporates rushed \par \par \uc2  to hedge their dollar requirements for the second half of 2001. \par \par \uc2      The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  repeated that it had not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \par \par \uc2  market on Tuesday. But governor Rafael Buenaventura said the \par \par \uc2  bank was ready to do so if necessary. \par \par \uc2      But dealers were suspicious about the impact of \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , given the bank's tiny \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves. \par \par \uc2      Official Philippine figures show gross international \par \par \uc2  reserves at the end of May stood at $14.44 billion. \par \par \uc2      Barclays Capital estimates about $7.2 billion of \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2  reserves are held in securities. Only $5 billion are in \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  or deposits, compared with Korea's $10.5 billion and \par \par \uc2  Indonesia's $6 billion. \par \par \uc2  "...the amount of unencumbered and liquid \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves is \par \par \uc2  likely to be much smaller than implied by the official reserve \par \par \uc2  assets number of $14.4 billion on its own," Barclays said in a \par \par \uc2  research note. \par \par \uc2  Analysts believe the worst is still not over for the peso. \par \par \uc2  "The Philippines is the risky place. Political risk was \par \par \uc2  very high towards the end of last year and that is giving very \par \par \uc2  high economic risk and security risk now," Bhanu Baweja, \par \par \uc2  regional economist at IDEAglobal in Singapore told Reuters \par \par \uc2  Television. \par \par \uc2  "All \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategists, traders, economists will have to \par \par \uc2  factor in a certain amount of security risk. So you will see a \par \par \uc2  weakening \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  here." \par \par \uc2  BAHT UNCERTAIN \par \par \uc2  The baht was another \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  unable to benefit from the \par \par \uc2  steadier yen, hitting one-month lows of 45.45 per dollar. \par \par \uc2      But traders were reluctant to bid the dollar up further on \par \par \uc2  fears of possible \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BOT). \par \par \uc2      They also turned cautious after the BOT and the government \par \par \uc2  said they had no plans to abandon the current managed float \par \par \uc2  regime for the baht and would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to stem any volatility. \par \par \uc2      Under new the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor, Pridiyathorn Devakula, \par \par \uc2  the BOT's policy focus has shifted from inflation targeting to \par \par \uc2  keeping \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves strong and deterring capital outflows. \par \par \uc2      Baweja of IDEAglobal was sceptical of this policy. \par \par \uc2      "I think Asia in general, again Thailand in particular, is \par \par \uc2  just attacking the symptoms of the disease, they are not really \par \par \uc2  going down to attack the cause of the disease," he said. \par \par \uc2      "Without taking on corporate reforms, without taking on \par \par \uc2  banking reforms, ...this kind of restricted regime is actually \par \par \uc2  going to mean that the flight of capital from Asia continues." \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 CURRENCIES\b0 \highlight\uc2  VS U.S. $0843 GMT \par \par \uc2  Change on the day \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2     Latest bid     Prev Close    Pct Move \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  Japan yen     123.89\tab  124.31\tab    +0.34\par  Sing dlr\tab 1.8210\tab  1.8217\tab    +0.04\par  Taiwan dlr    34.394\tab  34.428\tab    +0.10\par  Korean won   1290.00\tab 1299.00\tab    +0.70\par  Baht\tab      45.45\tab   45.29\tab    -0.35\par  Peso\tab      52.92\tab   52.70\tab  