\par\par \b \uc2  POLL-Thai baht seen slightly lower by end-2001. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Vithoon Amorn \par \uc2 423 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 2 Juli 2001\par 07:33\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par BANGKOK, July 2 (Reuters) - The baht\tab   will track an\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par expected softer yen and regional \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in the second half\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  of 2001, edging lower to 46 per dollar by the end of 2001 from \par \par \uc2  around 45.45 now, according to a Reuters poll. \par \par \uc2  The end-2001 forecast marks a downward revision in \par \par \uc2  analysts' projections. The last Reuters poll in January saw an \par \par \uc2  end-year forecast of 43.71. \par \par \uc2  Ten economists polled by Reuters predicted a steady to \par \par \uc2  slightly firmer baht in the first half of 2002. They expected \par \par \uc2  the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to trade at an average 45.79 per dollar in \par \par \uc2  mid-2002. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  analyst Hui-Chin Chong at JP Morgan Chase said: \par \par \uc2  "The baht would probably bottom out in September at around \par \par \uc2  47.50, which should be the most bearish in line with the yen. \par \par \uc2  It would also not be helped by a generally bearish outlook for \par \par \uc2  the overall Thai economy." \par \par \uc2  Usara Wilaipich of Standard Chartered Bank said pending \par \par \uc2  changes to Thai \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  reporting rules and the Bank of \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2 's signal of its readiness to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to stabilise \par \par \uc2  the baht had kept the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  stable for most of the past \par \par \uc2  month. \par \par \uc2  "For a one-month forecast, we don't think the baht would go \par \par \uc2  anywhere. It would be rangebound at around 45.50. There's a lot \par \par \uc2  of confusion over the \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  rules and \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy. People \par \par \uc2  therefore prefer to stay on the sidelines than to take a \par \par \uc2  position," she said. \par \par \uc2  Suvit Patangkaro of the SCB Research Institute said the \par \par \uc2  baht should strengthen slightly in the first half of 2002, with \par \par \uc2  expected higher Thai interest rates helping stem capital \par \par \uc2  outflows. \par \par \uc2  He said Thai economic growth should pick up in 2002 in line \par \par \uc2  with a more robust world economy. \par \par \uc2  Baht/dollar rate in previous years (year-end): \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 1996\tab \tab   25.34\par 1997\tab \tab   47.247\par 1998\tab \tab   36.688\par 1999\tab \tab   37.520\par 2000\tab \tab   43.35\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par -----\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 5-year average    38.029\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The results of the survey are as follows:\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par End-2001    Mid-2002\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Bangkok Bank\tab \tab      46.00\tab  46.75\par Goldman Sachs\tab \tab     47.00\tab  47.00\par JP Morgan Chase\tab \tab   46.00\tab  45.00\par KGI Securities\tab \tab    45.00\tab  45.00\par Merrill Lynch Phatra\tab    45.00\tab  46.00\par Rabobank\tab \tab \tab    48.00\tab  47.50\par S&P/MMS\tab \tab \tab     48.00\tab  48.00\par SCB Research Institute\tab  45.50\tab  45.10\par Standard Chartered Bank\tab 44.50\tab  44.50\par Vickers Ballas\tab \tab    45.00\tab  43.00\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par -------------------------------------------------\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Average\tab \tab \tab     46.00\tab  45.79\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par -------------------------------------------------\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Previous 