\par\par \b \uc2  Thai Ctrl Bk Gov Confirms It  \highlight22\uc2 Intervened \highlight\uc2  In  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2  Mkt \b0\par\par\uc2 1,033 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 Juni 2001\par 08:07\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.\par \par \uc2  BANGKOK -(Dow Jones)- Thai \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Governor Pridiyathorn Devakula confirmed Thursday that the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market Wednesday to cap the baht's rise. \par \par \uc2  Pridiyathorn told reporters that the move was in line with the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's managed float system aimed at keeping the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  stable. \par \par \uc2  The baht had strengthened to below 44.80 baht to the dollar early Wednesday over confusion surrounding the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's new \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  requirement rules which were to go into effect July 2. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The new reporting forms were later withdrawn for a review. The baht\par retreated back above THB45.00 to the dollar after the move.\par - - 07/06/01 06-22G\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "We want to stabilize the market which will facilitate business\par activity," Pridiyathorn said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par He said the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's policy to raise interbank interest rates is\par aimed at slowing down debt repayment by the private sector and also\par slowdown the debt conversion from the U.S. dollar to the Thai baht.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Pridiyathorn said that the impact of higher rates on the bond market -\par where yields rose sharply on the rate hike expectations - will be short\par lived and only a one-time effect.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Pridiyathorn said that the losses the bond market is suffering from\par now are "quite small compared to the gains it has posted so far on the\par back of low interest rates.\par - - 07/06/01 07-04G\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "In business there is an equal chance that you earn or lose, that\par makes it fun," Pridiyathorn said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par He said the move by some private companies to postpone planned\par debenture issues was a "good move", proving that his policy is\par effective.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "The higher rate will make the issuance too costly for them," he said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Property developer Central Pattana PCL (H.CPT) and Khanom Electricity\par Generating Co. earlier this week postponed issues worth 1.5 billion baht\par ($1=THB45.020) and THB7.5 billion, respectively, waiting instead for\par better market conditions.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Responding to the question about the impact of higher rates on the\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's Financial Institutions Development Fund, or FIDF, which\par is the largest borrower in the interbank and repurchase markets,\par Pridiyathorn said the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  can handle the impact.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The higher interbank rates are expected to raise FIDF's interest\par costs. The higher burden could then turn on tax payers as the government\par is required to give full support to the fund.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "I know what I have done. I do it with full consciousness. It (the\par policy) may create some damage, but I look for greater returns later,"\par he said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par -By Suttinee Yuvejwattana, Dow Jones Newswires; 662-266-0744;\par suttinee.yuvejwattana@dowjones.com\par -0- 07/06/01 08-18G\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par BANGKOK (Dow Jones)--Thailand needs low interest rates for at least\par another two to three quarters to allow the new state asset management\par agency and additional fiscal measures work their way through the\par economy, Citibank economist Anusorn Tamajai said Thursday.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Anusorn, a respected economist known to be close to current Finance\par Minister Somkid Jatusripitak, called on the government to quickly\par clarify its stance on interest rates as recent confusing signals might\par hurt confidence and the recovery process.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "If they are against high rates, they have to send clear signals,"\par Anusorn said, referring to a recent comment by the authorities that\par domestic deposit rates were currently too low.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Anusorn told a press briefing that he agreed with the new \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \par Governor Pridiyathorn Devakula that interbank rates should be higher\par than deposit rates, but he added that moves in that direction would have\par to be made carefully to avoid pushing up deposit rates.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "And, at this point, banks couldn't carry higher deposit rates without\par increasing lending rates, which would go against what the economy\par needs," he said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "The net effect is that I cannot see how (higher deposit rates) could\par help the economy in the short-term," he said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Pridiyathorn replaced Chatu Mongol Sonakul who was sacked last week\par following a dispute with the government over the suitability of the low\par interest rate policy.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The new governor said higher interest rates will help stem capital\par outflows and slow early debt repayment.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par    Econ, Export Growth Forecasts Cut\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Anusorn said that Citibank had revised its forecast for Thailand's\par gross domestic product growth this year to 3.1%, from 3.6% previously,\par and has cut its export growth forecast to 0.5%, from 6% earlier.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par He said the cuts had been made due to worries over some local policy\par factors and the continued impact of external factors, despite an upward\par adjustment in Citibank's forecast for the U.S. economic growth from 1.6%\par to 1.9%.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par In that situation, a rather weak baht is still needed to help exports,\par he said. But, he added, it's more important that the government increase\par fiscal stimulus to boost domestic consumption - something higher rates\par couldn't achieve.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "Higher deposit rates wouldn't benefit the public in general as most\par deposits are concentrated in the hands of a minority. That would also go\par against several other policies of the new government, which targets a\par better income distribution to a larger number of people," he said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Anusorn noted that the confusion over the interest rate policy has\par already had a severe effect on the bond market, which has almost stopped\par functioning, and is also harming the equities market.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "This goes against the need to build up these two markets to avoid an\par excessive reliance of the economy on the banking sector," he said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Among the few positive results higher rates could have is the\par strengthening of the baht, Anusorn said. He warned, however, this could\par be short-lived as the exchange rate system is still a flexible managed\par float system.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Pridiyathorn has said he wants to keep the baht stable and maintain\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  reserves above $30 billion.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Anusorn said the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  shouldn't focus on \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign\par exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 -reserve targeting but should maintain its focus on the\par inflation targeting system, devised under the previous governor.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par He said a policy of price stability and is most appropriate for the\par managed float system.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par -By Laurent Malespine, Dow Jones Newswires; 662-2660744,\par Laurent.Malespine@Dowjones.com\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010711dx6702nkf\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
