\par\par \b \uc2  Thai Ctrl Bk: Situation In External Economies Worsens \b0\par\par\uc2 460 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 April 2001\par 13:23\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.\par \par \uc2  BANGKOK -(Dow Jones)- Thailand's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said Thursday the situation in external economies has worsened more than expected since the monetary policy board's last policy meeting in early March. \par \par \uc2  Thirachai Phuvanatnaranubala, \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  assistant governor for monetary policy, said after a preparatory meeting for the next policy meeting April 19, that exports from Thailand and the region have been hurt by the economic slowdown in the U.S. and Japan. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The board reviewed Thai and regional data for January and February,\par but it won't discuss what the trends mean for Thai monetary policy until\par next week's meeting, he said.\par - - 12/04/01 11-23G\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Thai exports in the first two months of the year dropped 3.4% from the\par same period last year, while Taiwan and Japan suffered declines of 4.4%\par and 4.5% over the period. Exports from Hong Kong and the Philippines\par continued to grow but at a sharply reduced rate from last year.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "In reaction to the slowdown, some countries have cut interest rates,\par including Hong Kong - due to its \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's ties to the U.S. dollar -\par but also Taiwan and the Philippines. Other countries took fiscal steps,"\par Thirachai said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par He gave no indication how the monetary policy board would react,\par saying it would be considered on April 19.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par No change is expected in the policy-signal 1.5% 14-day repurchase\par market interest rate, although some research houses believe a 25 basis\par point cut is possible.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par One of the factors the board will consider is the expected addition of\par 14.6 billion baht ($1=THB45.34) to liquidity during the fiscal year to\par Sept. 30 through stimulus measures planned by the Thai government, he\par said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Next fiscal year, planned policies will bring THB70 billion into the\par system, and the following year THB26 billion.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Another factor to be considered by the board will be the fall of the\par baht and other regional \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  due to the decline of the yen,\par Thirachai said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par He gave no indications of the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's view on \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \par rate movements.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Bank of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Thailand\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  acknowledged \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervening\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  markets\par two weeks ago when the baht hit a 37-month low of 45.45 baht to the\par dollar.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par A rebound in the yen and concern about possible \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  by\par regional central banks have prompted investors to unwind long-dollar\par positions against the baht and other regional \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The dollar closed Thursday ahead of a four-day weekend at THB45.34,\par down from a new 37-month high of THB45.85 earlier in the week.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par -By Laurent Malespine and Tom Fox, Dow Jones Newswires; 662 266 0744;\par Laurent.Malespine@Dowjones.com\par -0- 12/04/01 11-46G\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010711dx4c01kvp\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
