\par\par \b \uc2  Thai Ctrl Bk/Baht -3: Baht Shouldn't Weaken Much Further [o-dji n/aer n/wer n/ewr n/bkg n/fxw n/cmr \b0\par\par\uc2 541 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 April 2001\par 08:09\par \uc2  Emerging Markets Report \par \uc2 EM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.\par \par \uc2  Chettavee said that Thai \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  policies leave the market well controlled and that there is no need for any new measures. \par \par \uc2  Bank of Thailand restricts the flow of baht to offshore markets in order to raise the cost of covering short-baht positions by borrowing in offshore \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  swap markets. \par \par \uc2  Local dealers are required to name parties and define the purpose of all \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  transactions, helping the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to monitor capital flows and compliance. \par \par \uc2  Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the offshore spot, forward and swap markets last week to further dry up liquidity and slow the baht's decline. \par \par \uc2  But officials have said repeatedly that most of the recent volatility was due to the dollar's rise against the yen and other regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , and that there has been no abnormal speculative activity. \par \par \uc2  Chettavee said the baht has also received some support from the country's economic fundamentals. \par \par \uc2  If domestic confidence is good, the baht shouldn't weaken much further, Chettavee said, without specifying how far the baht might weaken or which aspects of the domestic economy were supportive. \par \par \uc2  Analysts expect the baht to weaken slowly until U.S. and global demand for Thai exports begins to recover later in the year. \par \par \uc2  At midday Monday, the dollar was trading at 37-month highs between THB45.80 and THB45.83, up from a range of THB45.60 to THB45.65 late Friday in Asian trade. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par -By Phisanu Phromchanya, Dow Jones Newswires; 662-266-0744;\par phisanu.phromchanya@dowjones.com\par -0- 09/04/01 06-09G\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Chettavee said that Thai \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  policies leave the market\par well controlled and that there is no need for any new measures.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Bank of Thailand restricts the flow of baht to offshore markets in\par order to raise the cost of covering short-baht positions by borrowing in\par offshore \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  swap markets.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Local dealers are required to name parties and define the purpose of\par all \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  transactions, helping the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to monitor\par capital flows and compliance.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Bank of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Thailand intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in the offshore spot, forward and swap\par markets last week to further dry up liquidity and slow the baht's\par decline.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par But officials have said repeatedly that most of the recent volatility\par was due to the dollar's rise against the yen and other regional\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , and that there has been no abnormal speculative activity.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Chettavee said the baht has also received some support from the\par country's economic fundamentals.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par If domestic confidence is good, the baht shouldn't weaken much\par further, Chettavee said, without specifying how far the baht might\par weaken or which aspects of the domestic economy were supportive.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \pa