\par\par \b \uc2  Thai Ctrl Bk  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Reported; Baht Mkt Cautious \b0\par\par\uc2 939 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 4 April 2001\par 07:02\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.\par \par \uc2  BANGKOK -(Dow Jones)- \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2 -based dealers said Wednesday they believe the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold dollars offshore at the Asian close Tuesday, to convince offshore analysts and local companies that they will oppose a weakening of the baht in excess of the regional trend. \par \par \uc2  A bank treasurer said the sharp movement in the dollar from its 37-month high of 45.40 baht late Tuesday to THB45.15 within 45 minutes, was due to dollar selling by an offshore bank that was probably acting on behalf of the Bank of Thailand. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  officials weren't immediately available for comment. They usually refuse to comment on alleged \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  If the authorities did act, the treasurer said, the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was smart, small and well-timed, complementing controls on baht outflows which restrict liquidity in offshore markets and driving the dollar to a low of of THB45.11 in London overnight. \par \par \uc2  "Fear that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  could come back in the market at that level (THB45.40) will be a good excuse for profit-taking," whenever the dollar tests resistance on Wednesday, the treasurer said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has sufficient reserves - $32.6 billion as of March 23 - for limited, well-timed \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  to further tighten offshore liquidity and punish speculative excesses. \par \par \uc2  The bigger threat to speculators is the close monitoring of \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  transactions of local banks, which enables the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to enforce outflow restrictions and choke off baht supply to offshore \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  swap markets. \par \par \uc2  Whenever the baht begins to fall, demand for baht to cover short positions quickly pushes up the cost of borrowing baht in swap markets, forcing investors to buy baht directly in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  spot markets. \par \par \uc2  Implied annual interest rates to borrow baht through offshore swaps have been around 20% or more in recent days, making speculative trades against the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  unprofitable. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. dollar was trading Wednesday morning in a range of THB45.20 to THB45.30, after profit-taking reversed an early test of THB45.35. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Dealers expect the dollar to remain in a range of THB45.10 to THB45.40\par Wednesday, unless the U.S. unit begins to climb again against the\par Japanese yen and the Singapore dollar.\par - - 04/04/01 05-02G\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Assistant \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  governor Bandid Nijathavorn told reporters\par later Wednesday that the authorities stand ready to \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  if the\par baht weakens inappropriately.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  is concerned about day-to-day baht volatility, and\par direct \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in the market is one of the tools available to\par authorities, he said. He refused to comment on the reports of\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  late Tuesday.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Finance Minister Somkid Jatusripitak said separately that the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central\par bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  didn't \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , and that he wasn't concerned about the baht.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Analysts said the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's alleged actions and authorities'\par verbal \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 interventions\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  this week are designed to slow the slide in the\par baht, rather than reverse it, because Thailand needs to maintain export\par competitiveness with regional neighbors.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "We doubt all the (verbal \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 ) signals an interest in\par arresting the baht's slow slide, but rather to keep the pace measured\par and deliberate," given the declining level of exports recently from last\par year's levels, IDEAglobal said in a daily report Wednesday.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Prime Minister Thaksin Shinawatra's recent comment that the baht\par shouldn't fall much further may be aimed more at restoring the\par confidence of Thai exporters and importers, than at scaring away\par speculators.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Since the dollar began rising sharply last month from below THB43,\par Thai companies began shifting the timing of impending \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \par transactions, analysts said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "I think it's safe to say that exporters were holding back their\par revenues," Kim Eng head of research Richard Henderson told Dow Jones\par Newswires.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par While dollar sales were delayed, importers and debtors expedited\par dollar purchases to meet upcoming obligations, he said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Bank of Thailand requires a lot of paperwork from local companies and\par dealers involved in \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  transactions, but a shift in the\par timing of authorized deals can have a significant effect.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Firms expedited dollar sales and delayed purchases in January, after\par the overwhelming victory of Thaksin's Thai Rak Thai Party in the general\par elections sharply reduced political uncertainty and restored a relative\par measure of confidence in economic prospects.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The dollar fell from around THB44 in December to almost THB42 in\par February.\par - - 04/04/01 07-19G\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Analysts say exporters' failure to repatriate earnings shows up in\par "errors and omissions" in the balance of payments.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Last year, exporters contributed to errors which showed up as outflows\par - but were mostly inflows in the trade balance which didn't materialize\par - of several hundred million dollars a month, they said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par In January, an inflow under errors and omissions was recorded at $916\par million, nearly balancing outflows in the capital account of $946\par million.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Henderson said corporate repatriation of dollars held offshore last\par year may represent a significant percentage of those January inflows.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Capital account and error flows for March won't be reported until the\par end of May, but Henderson expects to see a significant reversal to\par outflows under the error category.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Meanwhile, capital account outflows to repay foreign debt will\par continue to absorb current account and trade balance inflows, as\par corporates issue local bonds to refinance and restructure debt burdens,\par he said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par After Somkid's comments mid-afternoon Wednesday, the dollar rose\par briefly to a new 37-month high of THB45.48 amid renewed local corporate\par demand, before falling back to a range of THB45.40 to THB45.45.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par -By Tom Fox, Dow Jones Newswires; 662-266-0744; tom.fox@dowjones.com\par -0- 04/04/01 07-27G\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010711dx4401iwu\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
