\par\par \b \uc2  Thai PM: Govt Not To  \highlight22\uc2 Intervene \highlight\uc2  In  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2  Mkt \b0\par\par\uc2 240 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 1 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2001\par 09:32\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.\par \par \uc2  BANGKOK -(Dow Jones)- \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2 's Prime Minister Thaksin Shinawatra reiterated Thursday that the government won't \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to defend the baht following the release of unfavorable economic data. \par \par \uc2  "We cannot \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 , because if we entered the market we would lose our credibility. At this point the exchange rate is not in a dangerous situation," he told reporters. \par \par \uc2  He added that the recent economic data "show there is a problem that we must work hard to address and correct urgently. We are not overconfident but there is no reason to panic." \par \par \uc2  According to data released by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Wednesday, Thai exports slipped 3.9% in January while imports surged 31.3% to drive the monthly trade balance into a $282 million deficit, the first in 11 months. \par \par \uc2  Thaksin added that by the middle of next month, the government will release data showing the economic situation of the country, in particular the investment situation. \par \par \uc2  The government is currently in the process of gathering and reviewing all the data to ensure its assessments are correct, he said. \par \par \uc2  The objective of the data release will be to explain to the people what the actual situation is, how it compares with the established targets and to serve as the base of coordinated government action, he added. \par \par \uc2  -By Laurent Malespine, Dow Jones Newswires; 662-266 0744; laurent.malespine@dowjones.com \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010711dx3100wc9\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
