\par\par \b \uc2  Thai Ctrl Bk: Baht Weakness Due To Regional Dlr Strength \b0\par\par\uc2 217 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 18 Juli 2000\par 10:56\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2000, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BANGKOK -(Dow Jones)- Thailand's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said Tuesday recent movements in the baht exchange rate were due mainly to the strength of the dollar against regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , although outflows for repayment of foreign debt and political uncertainty also contributed to weakness in the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Pakorn Malakul Na Ayudhya, Bank of Thailand's deputy governor for monetary policy, told a news conference that political uncertainty in Indonesia and the Philippines contributed to the regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  weakness. \par \par \uc2  A "wait and see" attitude, normal among investors ahead of general elections expected in Thailand in the fourth quarter, was also contributing to the baht's weakness, he said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  observed "nothing abnormal" in capital outflows, much of it for repayment of foreign debt, Pakorn said. \par \par \uc2  Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2  has a policy to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets only to counter what it terms speculative, abnormal or irrational capital flows. \par \par \uc2  Reduction of foreign debt will be positive for the country and the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the long term, he added. \par \par \uc2  Pakorn was speaking after a meeting of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's Monetary Policy Board, at which the board decided to maintain a low interest rate environment, as expected. \par \par \uc2  -By Laurent Malespine; 662-266-0744; laurent.malespine@dowjones.com \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010805dw7i03hm7\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
