\par\par \b \uc2  Thai Ctrl Bk Gov:Draft Law Delays Won't Hinder  \highlight22\uc2 Operations \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 458 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 Juli 2000\par 09:15\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2000, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BANGKOK -(Dow Jones)- Thai \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Governor Chatu Mongol Sonakul said Wednesday that delays in Parliamentary approval of draft laws governing the Bank of Thailand until next year won't hinder \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Chatu Mongol told reporters on the sidelines of a seminar that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is already conducting monetary policy under the framework of the draft Bank of Thailand Act. \par \par \uc2  Meanwhile, the combination of \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  accounts under a separate draft \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  Act won't hinder money and \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2 , because the authorities don't have a policy to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  aggressively, he said. \par \par \uc2  The current Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2  act calls for a fixed exchange rate, which was overwhelmed by market forces and scrapped in 1997. \par \par \uc2  The new law balances the power of the governor with the creation of a Monetary Policy Board to set policy under a flexible inflation-targeting framework, aiming for low inflation and stable financial institutions. \par \par \uc2  The board will hold its second meeting July 18, to consider forecasts for the economy, \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  rates and the effects of high oil prices over the next two years. \par \par \uc2  At its first meeting last month, the board set a target range of 0% to 3.5% for core inflation, defined as consumer price index inflation minus volatile food and energy prices. \par \par \uc2  Under the current \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  Act, reserves backing notes and coins in circulation are kept separate from other accounts, and aren't available for other essential monetary \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Chatu Mongol said that until the draft act to modernize the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's accounting is approved, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will have to be very careful about any decision to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  aggressively in markets. \par \par \uc2  Prime Minister Chuan Leekpai said Tuesday that the \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  Act won't be placed on the Parliament's agenda during the current term, so that the government can pursue more vital legislation in the limited time remaining. \par \par \uc2  More than 100 opposition members of Parliament have resigned in a bid to force the government to dissolve the lower house early and hold new elections. \par \par \uc2  But the government has said it must first pass electoral reforms and a budget for the year beginning Oct. 1. \par \par \uc2  The government was under pressure from certain social and political groups to scrap the \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  Act due to a clause viewed as a bailout of rich bankers, which provides for a one-time transfer from reserves of THB132 billion plus interest to the state's rescue fund for financial institutions. \par \par \uc2  The fund is expected to realize losses of around THB1 trillion in the next five to ten years, which must otherwise be borne by taxpayers. \par \par \uc2  -By Suttinee Yuvejwattana, Dow Jones Newswires; 662-266-0744; suttinee.yuvejwattana@dowjones.com \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010805dw7c03ec2\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\p