\par\par \b \uc2  Merrill sees Thai cenbank tolerating weaker baht. \b0\par\par\uc2 339 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 Mai 2000\par 07:40\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2000 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  SINGAPORE, May 16 (Reuters) - Despite its recent rumoured \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 , \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is unlikely to be overly concerned about the baht's weakness as long as inflation does not overshoot its targets, Merrill Lynch said. \par \par \uc2  The Bank of Thailand has projected a 2.5-3.0 percent inflation rate for 2000 against 0.3 percent in 1999. \par \par \uc2  "Our baht forecast rests mainly on domestic inflation," said Suvavud Saicheua, head of Thailand economics at Merrill Lynch in a note to clients. \par \par \uc2  "As long as inflation does not exceed four percent, we believe that the Bank of Thailand can tolerate some baht weakness," he said. \par \par \uc2  The report said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is likely to leave interest rates unchanged for the next 12 months to keep Thailand's economic recovery on track despite growing prospects for more aggressive interest rate increases in the U.S. \par \par \uc2  This means it will have to be more tolerant of a weaker baht. \par \par \uc2  "Recent Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to push the baht back below 39 per dollar does not imply a baht target in our view. Rather, it suggests that the BOT would like to increase the cost of speculation against the baht," Supavud said. \par \par \uc2  "The three percent baht depreciation from 1999 would push inflation up by only 1.0-1.5 percent in our estimation...," he said, citing factors including declining food prices. \par \par \uc2  The baht was quoted at 39.26/31 per dollar at 0527 GMT, down some 4.6 percent from its end-1999 level of 37.45, based on Reuters Graphics data. \par \par \uc2  Merrill said it was sticking to its recently revised forecast of 39 baht per dollar for the fourth quarter and the rest of 2001, although occasional weakness beyond this level could not be ruled out. \par \par \uc2  Merrill lowered the forecast earlier this month from a previous projection of 38.00 per dollar. \par \par \uc2  ((Anchalee Koetsawang, Asia \b \highlight22\uc2 Forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  Desk +65 870-3090; fax (65) 870-3787; email: asia.\b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2 @reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 2000. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010821dw5g00glx\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
