\par\par \b \uc2  Thai Ctrl Bk Reiterates  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2  Non- \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Policy \b0\par\par\uc2 205 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 Mai 2000\par 07:37\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2000, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BANGKOK -(Dow Jones)- \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Thursday reiterated its policy of letting the market set the baht's level, despite continued weakness in the local unit. \par \par \uc2  At 0540 GMT (1:40 a.m. EDT), the dollar was at THB39.065, much higher than THB38.765 earlier Thursday. The baht hasn't closed below THB39 to the dollar for six months. \par \par \uc2  Despite the weakness, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will continue its laissez-faire approach to the market, Chetthavee Charoenpitaks, an assistant governor, told reporters. \par \par \uc2  Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2  only \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market to moderate huge speculative movements in the baht, which it feels doesn't have an underlying link to real capital flows. \par \par \uc2  Weakness in regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , notably Indonesia's rupiah, were helping pull the baht lower, Chetthavee said. \par \par \uc2  Offshore investors are moving quickly midday Thursday to take long dollar positions, amid concerns that the U.S. will raise rates next week, further hurting Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Thailand's lingering economic problems, including a stubbornly high level of nonperforming loans, are also hurting investor sentiment, causing a huge outflow of foreign funds from the local stock market, which is at 14-month lows. \par \par \uc2  -Dow Jones Newswires; 662-266-0744 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010805dw5b02d1o\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
