\par\par \b \uc2  Thai Ctrl Bk: Won't  \highlight22\uc2 Intervene \highlight\uc2  In Baht Despite Weakness \b0\par\par\uc2 180 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 4 Mai 2000\par 11:07\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2000, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BANGKOK -(Dow Jones)- \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said Thursday it won't \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to support the baht despite the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's recent weakness. \par \par \uc2  Teerachai Phuvanatnaranubala, a Bank of Thailand assistant governor, confirmed the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's policy to let the market set the baht's level. \par \par \uc2  "As long as the baht moves on market demand, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  won't \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market," he told reporters. \par \par \uc2  Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2  only \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  when it sees huge speculative money movements distorting fundamental capital flows. \par \par \uc2  In late trade, offshore investors pushed the dollar through resistance at THB38.50, its lowest level in five months. \par \par \uc2  The baht's weakness is due to offshore investors speculating that the U.S. Federal Reserve will hike interest rates at its next meeting May 16, Teerachai said. \par \par \uc2  Higher rates in the U.S. could attract funds out of Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  into dollar assets, analysts say. However, most analysts see the baht higher by the year end on a strong current account surplus and rising foreign direct investment. \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010805dw54029gc\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal33